  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>On simplifying we get the quadratic equations as<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><munder><munder><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>&#9183;</mo></munder><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>times</mtext></mrow></munder></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></math><br /><math><mi>n</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;are the roots of the above equation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br />Now, the difference of roots<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#160;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>121</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p>"
